GIVEN user creates a new Facility with name "f1" and abbreviation "ab1"
WHEN user calls method SQLiteDataStore.addFacility()
THEN the facility is inserted into the database and the returned facility contains the expected facility ID, name, and abbreviation
AND user can retrieve the inserted facility using SQLiteDataStore.getFacility()

Scenario: addBriefInsertsCorrectly | User adds a new brief
GIVEN user creates a new Brief with mission ID 1, title "b1", date "1990-03-12", and content "content 1"
WHEN user calls method SQLiteDataStore.addBrief()
THEN the brief is inserted into the database and the returned brief contains the expected brief ID, mission ID, title, date, and content
AND user can retrieve the inserted brief using SQLiteDataStore.getBrief()

Scenario: addAgentInsertsCorrectly | User adds a new agent
