Scenario: addLogInsertsCorrectly | User adds a new log entry
GIVEN user retrieves an existing user and records the original number of logs associated with that user
WHEN user creates a LoggedAction with date and time "2024-10-25" and record "Agents", then calls method SQLiteDataStore.addLog()
THEN the returned log contains the expected user ID, action, date and time, and record
