Scenario: addUserInsertsCorrectly | User adds a new user
GIVEN user creates a new User with username "testUser1"
WHEN user calls method SQLiteDataStore.addUser()
THEN the returned user contains the expected username
AND user can retrieve the inserted user using SQLiteDataStore.getUser(), which returns the expected user ID and username

Case assignAgentToMissionSuccessfully: Attempts to assign an agent to a
mission and verifies the the assignment was made successfully

Case assignAgentToMultipleMissions: Attempts to assign 2 missions to a
an agent and verifies that the assignment was successful

Case assignAgentsFromDifferentFacilitiesToMission: Creates 2 agents, each
assigned to a different facility and attempts to assign both to a mission

Case assignAgentToMissionRejectsDuplicateAssignment: Attempts to assign an
agent to a mission it's already assigned to. It verifies that this fails

Case unassignAgentFromMissionSuccessfully: Attempts to unassign a mission
from an agent and checks for success

Case listMissionsForAgentReturnsAssignedMissions: Verifies correct return
when requesting a mission list for an agent

Case listAgentsForMissionReturnsAssignedAgents: Verifies correct return
when requesting an agent list for a mission

Case listBriefsForMissionReturnsBriefs: Verifies newly stored briefs for
a mission are returned in the mission's brief list

Case getUserByNameReturnsExistingUser: Verifies that getUserByName returns
the correct user identified by the passed username

Case addMessageInsertsCorrectly: Verify that a message inserted with
addMessage is successfully added

Case updateMessageModifies: Verifies that a message is properly modified
when passing it to updateMessage

Case addCountryInsertsCorrectly: Verifies that a country is properly added
when it is passed to addCountry

Case getCountryReturnsCorrectly: Verifies that getCountry returns the
proper country when passed an ID

Case updateCountryModifies: Verifies that a country is properly modified
when passing it to updateCountry

Case listCountriesValidity: Verifies that listCountries properly returns a
list of countries in the database

Case accessCountryFacilities: Verifies that the correct facilities are
returned by accessCountryFacilities when given a country ID

Case updateMissionModifies: Verifies that a mission is properly modified
when passing it to updateMission

Case getAgentByNameReturnAgent: Verifies that getAgentByName correctly
returns an existing agent with the passed name

Case getAgentByNameNullForNonexistent: Verifies that getAgentByName
returns null for a name that isn't in the database for an agent

Case updateAgentModifies: Verifies that an agent is properly modified
when passing it to updateAgent

Case updateFacilityModifies: Verifies that a facility is properly modified
when passing it to updateFacility

Case updateBriefsModifies: Verifies that a brief is properly modified
when passing it to updateBrief

Case messagesListForAgent: Verifies an agent with a message is given a
list with the proper message

Case messagesListEmptyForAgent: Verifies an agent with no messages is
given an empty message list